{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-f1fth-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-f1-fth-tower","about":"The F1FTH is Object 1's upcoming project, located in District 16 of Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC). The tower features 36 floors, with the ground level dedicated to parking and retail areas, a podium floor for amenities, and the rest of the stories for residential purposes. The F1fth Tower floor plan boasts studio, 1, and 2-bedroom ultra-luxury apartments. The amenities are inspired by the four natural elements: fire (BBQ area steam rooms and saunas), water (pools), air (playground and gym), and earth (lush green gardens).Get ready for top-notch family time at The F1fth Tower Apartments, where you will find the best convenience and comfort. The F1th Tower's location in the heart of JVC provides residents easy access to many city landmarks, such as Dubai Miracle Garden, The Els Club, and the Mall of the Emirates.","price":895590,"title":"The F1FTH Tower","bitrix":{"id":390,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The F1FTH Tower","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The F1FTH Tower","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Object 1","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/fifth_feature_2e8844adf1.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/fifth_feature_2e8844adf1.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0565986,"lng":55.2079657},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/fifth_1_abaebce924.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/fifth_1_abaebce924.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/fifth_2_d98367906a.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/fifth_2_d98367906a.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/fifth_